{"id":"n70107-1-7","stage":5,"title":"월차 · 月次","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70107-1-7-1","ko":"이번 달에는 쉬는 날 없어?","zh":"这个月没有休息的日子吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달에는","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬는","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8aea026dd0cc6426f688.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70107-1-7-2","ko":"응, 월차를 안 쓰고 모아 놨다가 여름에 한 번에 쓸 생각이야.","zh":"嗯，我打算先攒着每月的带薪休假，到夏天一起休。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"월차를","meaning":"月次，月度，每月","explanation":"월차：月次，月度，每月；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"월차","audio":"/audio/1c4e0d83b65658622c72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70107","senseId":"1","lemma":"월차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모아","meaning":"积攒，储存，积蓄","explanation":"모으다：积攒，储存，积蓄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"3","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놨다가","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여름에","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번에","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이야.","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1c4e0d83b6565862","term":"월차","zh":"月次，月度，每月","audio":"/audio/1c4e0d83b65658622c72.mp3","entryId":"70107","definition":"每个月轮回的顺序；或指每个月的休假。","pronunciation":["월차"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"5ddf1bf1c10eabe3","term":"모으다","zh":"积攒，储存，积蓄","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3","entryId":"74137","definition":"不花掉钱财等，而是把它们存起来。","pronunciation":["모으다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/17c992b0674e5ba6f70d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.473,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70107","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个月没有休息的日子吗？","嗯，我打算先攒着每月的带薪休假，到夏天一起休。","现在大家哪怕活到九十岁也完全没问题啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个月没有休息的日子吗？","嗯，我打算先攒着每月的带薪休假，到夏天一起休。","现在大家哪怕活到九十岁也完全没问题啊。"],"answer":1}]}
